# Copy this file to .env to customize your instance. It is read during
# `npm run build`. The site name is used for the PWA manifest at build time.
# Resolution order when building:
#   1. the SITE_NAME environment variable (this file or the shell),
#   2. the "Pingvin Share" fallback.
# update.sh exports SITE_NAME from the backend systemd unit automatically.
# SITE_NAME=My Instance
